; matrix case M-rescode-112: RAM:ev/ResCode/ResCode under EmuV0 112, from a fresh boot
Failat 30
Execute RAM:rxt/setup112.script
Echo >RESULTS:M-rescode-112.txt "run M-rescode-112"
Version RAM:emu112/EmuV0-pc FULL >>RESULTS:M-rescode-112.txt
Echo "== LIBSV0" >>RESULTS:M-rescode-112.txt
List LIBSV0: FILES LFORMAT="%n %l" >>RESULTS:M-rescode-112.txt
Echo "RAM:emu112/EmuV0-pc RAM:ev/ResCode/ResCode" >RAM:launch
Echo "== starting emulator in its own Shell" >>RESULTS:M-rescode-112.txt
NewShell "CON:0/560/500/150/rescode/AUTO" FROM RAM:launch
